### Inertial Follow-Back (inertial)

#### inertial
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="CardInertialDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const rebound = ref(0.12)
  const maxOffset = ref(26)
  </script>

  <template>
    <!-- inertial enables pointer-follow displacement; maxOffset / rebound are tunable via sliders in the demo source. -->
    <TxCard
      variant="solid"
      background="glass"
      shadow="none"
      inertial
      :inertial-max-offset="maxOffset"
      :inertial-rebound="rebound"
      :padding="14"
    >
      Inertial drag (move the mouse on hover, leave to snap back).
    </TxCard>
  </template>
---
:::

